  "goodToKnow": "Der Vizekanzler (die Vizekanzlerin) is the vice chancellor, the chancellor's deputy, usually a minister from the junior coalition partner, such as foreign or finance minister. Vize- means deputy: der Vizepräsident, der Vizemeister (runner-up), and German football's Bayer Leverkusen was once mocked as Vizekusen for so often finishing second, until winning the league in 2024. Plural: die Vizekanzler."
